# Local graphify build artifacts — not part of the shared knowledge-graph map.
# The committed map is graph.json, GRAPH_REPORT.md, graph.html and the
# .graphify_* / manifest.json sidecars; everything below is machine-local.

# Incremental AST cache and stat index (rebuilt on `graphify update`)
cache/

# Dated backups graphify writes before re-labelling
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/

# Machine-local pointer to the scan root (absolute path) — not portable
.graphify_root
